cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "stl-deviation: quantifying the geometric deviation between two STL surfaces"
abstract: "Python tool that compares two triangulated surfaces (STL) with exact signed point-to-surface distances, standard segmentation metrics (ASSD, RMS, Hausdorff, HD95, tolerance fractions, volume, Dice) and colour-mapped exports for ParaView, MeshLab and 3D Slicer."
